DESCRIPTION:
One case. One search. Sentinel pays for itself.

Licensed investigators and corporate security professionals don't have time to juggle 20 browser tabs, outdated databases, and manual FBI searches. Sentinel puts every tool you need in one secure, encrypted app — and delivers results in seconds.

THE MOST COMPLETE MOBILE OSINT TOOLKIT
11 modules. FBI · Interpol · OFAC · UN Sanctions · 50 States · Canada. AI Risk Score. All in one secure app — built for investigators, researchers, and security professionals.

INSTANT INTELLIGENCE ON ANY IDENTIFIER
Type a name, phone number, email, IP address, domain, or company. Sentinel detects the input automatically, searches 50+ sources simultaneously, and delivers a complete intelligence report — instantly. No setup. No switching apps. No wasted time.

AUTOMATIC FBI, INTERPOL & WANTED CHECKS
Every person search automatically runs against FBI Most Wanted, Interpol Red Notices, OFAC SDN Sanctions, UN Security Council Sanctions, EU Consolidated Sanctions, BIS Denied Persons List, US Marshals, DEA, ICE, ATF, Secret Service, all 50 US state wanted lists, RCMP, and Canadian provincial and city police databases. You don't have to ask. It just happens.

AI RISK SCORE — KNOW IN SECONDS (PRO)
Generate an AI Risk Score (0–100) on demand with classification: LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, or CRITICAL. Includes key findings, red flags, contradiction detection, and recommended next steps. Catch what manual searches miss.

BUILT FOR THE FIELD
- Person profiles, background intelligence, social media analysis
- Phone carrier, line type & region identification
- Email breach detection & domain intelligence
- IP geolocation, ISP, ASN & threat analysis
- Domain DNS, hosting & registration history
- Company records, SEC EDGAR & corporate registry
- Court records & public documents (PACER)
- Vehicle & plate history
- Geo-OSINT, satellite imagery & flight tracking

ENCRYPTED. SECURE. YOURS ALONE.
AES-256 encryption. Face ID / Touch ID. Keys stored in iOS Secure Enclave — never in the cloud. Auto-lock, tamper-proof audit log, and remote wipe. Your case files stay on your device, period.

COURT-READY DOCUMENTATION
Export any investigation as a professionally formatted PDF report. Built for legal documentation, case files, and client deliverables.

CHOOSE YOUR PLAN
Trial — 7 days free, all modules unlocked. No commitment.

